       flags: Additional flags for a host.
       adminDisabled: If the flag is true, the permissions on the host have been modified such
           that it is only accessible through local console or an authorized
           centralized management application.
           
           This flag is affected by the
           `pyVmomi.vim.HostSystem.enterLockdownMode` and
           `pyVmomi.vim.HostSystem.exitLockdownMode` operations.
           
           This flag is supported in VirtualCenter only. The value returned from host
           should be ignored.
       lockdownMode: Indicates the current lockdown mode of the host as reported by
           `pyVmomi.vim.host.HostAccessManager.lockdownMode`.
       ipmi: IPMI (Intelligent Platform Management Interface) info for the host.
       sslThumbprintInfo: SSL Thumbprint info for hosts registered on this host.
       sslThumbprintData: SSL Thumbprints registered on this host.
       authenticationData: Authentication info registered on this host.
           
           Since: vSphere API Release 9.0.0.0
       certificate: Full Host Certificate in PEM format, if known
       pciPassthruInfo: PCI passthrough information.
       authenticationManagerInfo: Current authentication configuration.
       featureVersion: List of feature-specific version information.
           
           Each element refers
           to the version information for a specific feature.
       powerSystemCapability: Host power management capability.
       powerSystemInfo: Host power management information.
       cacheConfigurationInfo: Host solid stats drive cache configuration information.
       wakeOnLanCapable: Indicates if a host is wake on lan capable.
           
           A host is deemed wake on lan capable if there exists at least one
           physical network card that is both backing the vmotion interface and
           is itself wake on lan capable.
       featureCapability: Array of host feature capabilities.
           
           This is expected to change
