              is connected to this port group.
          host: The VMkernel is connected to this port group.
          unknown: This port group serves an entity of unspecified kind.
      """
      virtualMachine: _typing.ClassVar['PortGroup.PortConnecteeType'] = 'virtualMachine'
      systemManagement: _typing.ClassVar['PortGroup.PortConnecteeType'] = 'systemManagement'
      host: _typing.ClassVar['PortGroup.PortConnecteeType'] = 'host'
