      etc.)
      
      Args:
          uuids: List of object UUIDs to be deleted.
          force: Optional force delete.
      
      Returns:
          List of DeleteVsanObjectsResult.
      
      Raises:
          pyVmomi.vim.fault.VimFault: The common base type for all virtual infrastructure management
              exceptions.
      """
      ...
